{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250030-the-dreaming-and-internet-games","id":1250030,"title":"The Dreaming and Internet Games?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-30T12:27:38-07:00","id":1250030,"title":"The Dreaming and Internet Games?","content":"So I am somewhat of a noob when it comes to changeling and I was wondering could one enter the digital web as a changeling and gather glamor from the dev's of a game server? I see a lot of Animas out there where people are in fully VR/AR MMO's and thought to my self that a lot like the dreaming where anything is possible. I don't know if this has ever been covered before and please direct me to any book that covers it. But could a program like &quot;Ready Player One&quot; become the new Dreaming or the next Arcadia?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T13:26:14-07:00","id":1250045,"title":"","content":"There's probably a way to do it, but in general, many would find it too complicated and time-intensive for relatively little return. The easier way would be to Muse the game designers during the design process, like standard Dreamers and such. <br /> <br /> <i>That being said. </i><br /> <br /> There are definitely parts of the Dreaming that look like video games, and Dream-Realms that do what you want them to do. Hopefully, we'll get to cover it more in depth in future books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","name":"Luka C","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3785_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T13:54:09-07:00","id":1250055,"title":"","content":"Doesn't the merit in KB bogan cover this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T14:21:49-07:00","id":1250063,"title":"","content":"I personally am a fan of the idea that the Fae have turned the Technocracy's own weapon against them, by using VR to create stabilized, artificial Freeholds!<br /> <br /> Somehow, I doubt that when the Tecnocracy set out to suppress mortal's faith in magic and superstition, they planned to introduce a form of entertainment that specifically introduces those concepts to millions of people everywhere!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-30-2018, 05:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://for