2019t exist. Bi have it certain AR games are a huge wellspring for Chimera Spawning. Imagine godlike Chimera being born from the Mewtwo raiding event in Japan, or Comic-Con and Blizzcon birthing magical godlike chimera from characters.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Isn't this in the Freeholds book? There was a freehold that spawned pokemon alikes that I thought was a clear reference to Pokemon nests in Pokemon Go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-27T17:36:51-07:00","id":1308410,"title":"","content":"In the short story collection &quot;Tapping the Dream Tree&quot; by Charles de Lint there is the story &quot;Pixel Pixies&quot; about pixies from the internet invading a used bookstore. There is also a Hob (Bogan) who hides in the bookstore and tidies up at night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1869-moonwolf8","name":"moonwolf8","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-28T21:21:54-07:00","id":1308593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250030-the-dreaming-and-internet-games?p=1252112#post1252112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By my Reckoning AR games are a HUGE wellspring if glamour. Check out when Pok\u00e9mon Go first became a thing, look up Pok\u00e9mon Go Santa Monica Pier, it was packed with people literally filling the pier to capacity all looking of whimsical monsters that don\u2019t exist. Bi have it certain AR games are a huge wellspring for Chimera Spawning. Imagine godlike Chimera being born from the Mewtwo raiding event in Japan, or Comic-Con and Blizzcon birthing magical godlike chimera from characters.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, there's a paralelism between a game where people see the world through their phones to see a virtual ecosystem overlayed on reality, and people who go through chrysalis and see a chimerical ecosystem overlayed on reality. What if some nocker entrepeneur creates an enchanted app to let people see the chimerical through their phones and disguises it as a game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23964-el-barto","name":"El Barto","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-29T01:26:42-07:00","id":1308624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>El Barto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250030-the-dreaming-and-internet-games?p=1308593#post1308593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, there's a paralelism between a game where people see the world through their phones to see a virtual ecosystem overlayed on reality, and people who go through chrysalis and see a chimerical ecosystem overlayed on reality. What if some nocker entrepeneur creates an enchanted app to let people see the chimerical through their phones and disguises it as a game?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That might be a serious glamour drain, though its a neat idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-29T06:55:39-07:00","id":1308672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>El Barto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250030-the-dreaming-and-internet-games?p=1308593#post1308593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, there's a paralelism between a game where people see the world through their phones to see a virtual ecosystem overlayed on reality, and people who go through chrysalis and see a chimerical ecosystem overlayed on reality. What if some nocker entrepeneur creates an enchanted app to let people see the chimerical through their phones and disguises it as a game?</div> </div> </div> </div>A Treasure computer program! I love it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-02T07:45:41-07:00","id":1309442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250030-the-dreaming-and-internet-games?p=1308672#post1308672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A Treasure computer program! I love it!</div> </div> </div> </div>Jedao's House of Wonders in the Players Guide opens the door wide for all this and more. ^_^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","name":"Luka C","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3785_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T17:24:10-07:00","id":1322307,"title":"","content":"In all honesty. I think that the house of Flickers from the Inanime would cover this ground for sure. They are basically forged innanime that can exist in a virtual video game. When you think of how the dreams of young dreamers have changed over the years you can only imagine that the BILLIONS of dollars that go into the video game industry don't also speak to their passions dreams and imaginations. Pokemon Go I'm sure there is something like it in WOD that has new Digi-chimera (tm).<br /> <br /> I'm already working on a chronicle set in Seattle that will dive into this. I have done video game Alpha testing since Everquest. So I plan to tie in some of the original cd keys into treasures that open one way paths of Balor to the Digital Dreaming. I plan on creating a digital dross system as well where there will be a mechanic to ravage via chat room trolling to harvesting glamour for helping a player win a championship MOBA. <br /> <br /> I see changeling as one of the most adaptable properties to the use of tech,. It would be an equalizer with other groups. The internet for me is a wellspring of glamour what are all of your thoughts around this.,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25339-sebastion","name":"Sebastion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25339_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-05T13:11:02-07:00","id":1322480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>El Barto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250030-the-dreaming-and-internet-games?p=1308593#post1308593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know, there's a paralelism between a game where people see the world through their phones to see a virtual ecosystem overlayed on reality, and people who go through chrysalis and see a chimerical ecosystem overlayed on reality. What if some nocker entrepeneur creates an enchanted app to let people see the chimerical through their phones and disguises it as a game?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sounds like the plot to a popular fantasy action kids series! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}